    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLine
      value: I wanted to paint a sun with my red and green... it turned out brown!
        But Mom says light isn't the same as paint.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondLine
      value: One day, I'm going to catch two rays of sunlight and trap them inside
        the big crystal. That way, I'll have my very own sun!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: solvedLine
      value: Did you see that? Did you see that?! It's all yellow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
