    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLine
      value: Careful with the crystals. Each one only sings when it gets exactly
        the right number of rays. Too many, or too few, and it stays silent.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondLine
      value: My grandmother used to say a lantern needs exactly two wicks to burn
        bright. One is too dim, three just smoke.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: solvedLine
      value: You see? Exactly right. Nothing more, nothing less.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
