      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcName
      value: Bastien
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLine
      value: "My lettuce was growing under the light of that crystal\u2014a soft
        blue-green, like the morning sky. Ever since it went out, they've been looking
        a bit glum."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondLine
      value: 'My grandfather used to say that this crystal had two parents: the forest
        and the sea. As for me, I never understood a thing about his stories.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: solvedLine
      value: My salads are finally going to get their color back. Thank you, traveler.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: planetCenter
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1252233775}
